WEBVTT

F01
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.050
<v Dispatch>Facilities and Receiving, radio check. Starting the dock flow drill.</v>

F02
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.750
<v Facilities>Facilities copies. Bay one is in service.</v>

F03
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.800
<v Receiving>Receiving copies. Empty pallets are staged by the west doors.</v>

F04
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:16.200
<v Yard>Dispatch, Yard. Cart C-14 is available at the west doors.</v>

F05
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:43.500
<v Dispatch>Yard, copy. Keep the intake aisle clear for the next cart.</v>

F06
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.600
<v Facilities>Bay three is OOS.</v>

F07
00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:01.150
<v Facilities>Facilities to Dispatch. The replacement latch is at the parts desk.</v>

F08
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:31.800
<v Receiving>Bay one is receiving totes. We have room for two more carts.</v>

F09
00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:13.100
<v Dispatch>Receiving, copy. Park the empties by the blue tape.</v>

F10
00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:52.400
<v Inventory>Inventory has four empty totes at the parts desk.</v>

F11
00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.300
<v Yard>Yard is moving empty pallets to the staging marks.</v>

F12
00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:12.950
<v Dispatch>Dispatch to Receiving. The tote count on this sheet is seven.</v>

F13
00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:42.250
<v Receiving>Copy seven totes. I have the same count at the desk.</v>

F14
00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.650
<v Facilities>Returns Cage one is open for returns.</v>

F15
00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:23.400
<v Receiving>The blue tote stack has been moved away from the intake aisle.</v>

F16
00:08:55.000 --> 00:09:00.000
<v Inventory>Inventory to Dispatch. The spare label roll is on the receiving desk.</v>

F17
00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:43.250
<v Dispatch>Copy the label roll. Leave the empty cartons on the lower shelf.</v>

F18
00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:47.150
<v Yard>Dispatch, Yard. Cart C-17 is staged beside Bay one.</v>

F19
00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:26.750
<v Receiving>Receiving counted eight empty totes at Bay one.</v>

F20
00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:09.100
<v Facilities>The parts desk still has one spare latch in the bin.</v>

F21
00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:53.600
<v Dispatch>Facilities, copy. The next check is the west door clearance.</v>

F22
00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:30.650
<v Yard>West doors are clear. The empty pallet stack is inside the tape.</v>

F23
00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:23.550
<v Receiving>All returned totes are on the lower shelves. The aisle is clear.</v>

F24
00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:57.450
<v Dispatch>End of drill. Leave the notes at the dispatch desk.</v>
